OpenDungeons_Version:0.7.1  # The version of OpenDungeons which created this file (for compatibility reasons).

[Info]
Name	The Four Gates
Description	The largest four player map: one crossroads, four gates onto it, and a long way home. Quarter turn symmetric. 4 players. A hero company holds 4 keeps in the wilds; storm them for their gold, or leave them be and fight whatever they send out.
Music	Searching_yd.ogg
FightMusic	TheDarkAmulet_MP.ogg
[/Info]

